<title>USA: Simon Transportation to expand fleet.</title>
<headline>Simon Transportation to expand fleet.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon Transportation Services Inc said on Monday that it has scheduled deliveries that would increase its fleet by 360 trucks during fiscal 1997, with options to purchase an additional 100 units.</p>
<p>Simon reported earnings for the first quarter ended December 31 of $0.26 a share, compared with $0.15 a share the previous first quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it currently has 1,011 tractors.</p>
